B.afN=new A.f8("You can view the number of credits that will be earned at the top right of the session (5).Note the price in the top right is set by default to the price you specified in your profile. You can also edit a particular session\u2019s fees if you wish and it will change the specified price for that particular session. Please note this price accounts for CLUE\u2019s portal fees. ",null)
B.afB=new A.f8("You can also specify the target students for the session. This is optional, but it will help the student find the session more easily.Students will be notified about the session and the students will be able to see it on CLUE dashboard.",null)
